  <is>Reading entry for the compiler runtime library</is>

  <documentation>
    @blockml/compiler exposes compileToOutput as the normative Stage-3 entry.
    Targets register via registerTarget(); the compiler ships no default targets.
    See docs/14_compiler_runtime.md for C2 Facade, C3 Target Bootstrap, C7 Compile Scope.
  </documentation>

</block>
